{\b\fs24 WinTidy}\par\par
WinTidy is free software, shared between friends.\par\par
{\b What it does:} WinTidy helps you clean up junk files, manage startup apps and services, and look for signs of suspicious activity on your PC. It only changes or deletes things when you click a button and confirm.\par\par
{\b No warranty:} WinTidy is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Deleting files and disabling programs or services can have side effects. Review what you select before cleaning, and consider creating a restore point first (Tools page). The author is not liable for any data loss or damage.\par\par
{\b Privacy:} WinTidy does not collect or send any data. Everything runs locally on your PC.\par\par
{\b Security scan:} The security check uses heuristics and is not a replacement for an antivirus program.\par
